#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_PopUp.UMG_PopUp_C:WidgetTree.T_WindowDesc.Text
#: /Game/Widgets/MainMenu/UMG_PopUp.UMG_PopUp_C:WidgetTree.T_WindowDesc.Text
